  title: dangerous diet
  speakingCharacters:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1ac0a97e9935a5844bca54735b28090f, type: 2}
    dialogueLines:
    - line: Advisor, the people have been feeling weak recently and are asking for
        a bloodletting event. They are willing to pay for that therapy, albeit it
        rarely shows actual benefits in my experience.
      choices:
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        conditionToHide: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: 'If the people want it, let them have it. '
        responseToChoice: I will announce it immediately.
        consequences:
        - type: 0
          amount: 350
        - type: 5
          amount: -20
        - type: 6
          amount: 10
        dailyChanges: []
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 0}
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        conditionToHide: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: I was never fond of this practice - I am sure the people will
          do fine without.
        responseToChoice: I must agree for once.
        consequences:
        - type: 6
          amount: -15
        dailyChanges: []
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 0}
